  "description": "ICOCOU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H70 Ce3 Mn2 N6 O28,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 9 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 9 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.186-3.737 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.31-108.33°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H72Ce3Mn2N6O29. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
